.SH NAME
datui\-keys \- the keys of every datui screen
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fB?\fR or \fBF1\fR on any screen shows that screen's keys. This page is the same text, screen by screen. Ctrl+Q quits from anywhere and Ctrl+O goes to the home screen.
.SH KEYS
